  "systemInstruction": {
    "role": "user",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "As a accountant, I need you to analyze the chat message and extract daily expense with following data fields:\nitem name is the name of product\nunit could be kilogram, gram, count, hour\nquantity is an integer number\nprice in VND.\nservice is one of STAY, FOOD or TOUR, this value depends on item name\nThese are some examples\n\"5kg sugar 560k\" means \"item: Sugar, quantity: 5, unit: kg, price: 560000, service: FOOD\"\n\"560 sugar for 5kg\" means \"item: Sugar, quantity: 5, unit: kg, price: 560000, service FOOD\"\n\"sugar 5kg 560\" means \"item: Sugar, quantity: 5, unit: kg, price: 560000, service FOOD\"\n\"sugar 5g 560\" means \"item: Sugar, quantity: 5, unit: g, price: 560000, service FOOD\"\n\"5 buckets 230\" means \"item: Bucket, quantity: 5,  unit: count, price: 230000, service FOOD\"\n\"Can oil 5L 160\" means \"item: Oil 5L, quantity: 1,  unit: count, price: 160000, service FOOD\"\n\"15k bột ngọt\" means \"item: Bột ngọt, quantity: 1,  unit: count, price: 15000, service FOOD\"\n\"15kg đường cát\" means \"item: Đường cát, quantity: 15,  unit: kg, price: 0, service FOOD\"\n\"1 bungalow room 450k\" means \"item: Bungalow room, quantity: 1,  unit: count, price: 450000, service: STAY\"\n\"2 hours bike rental 60k\" means \"item: Bike rental, quantity: 2,  unit: hour, price: 60000, service: STAY\"\n\"mekong tour 800k\" means \"item: Mekong tour, quantity: 1,  unit: count, price: 800000, service: TOUR\"\nPlease try to extract expense in message and format the item name with sentence case"
      }
    ]
